Z||000000||WKDFIRO||12-11-2000||04:52 AM||||Fieros of San Diego will be hosting the second annual Dinner Meeting and 2 Seater Car Show will be held on January 13th, 2001 at the Janacha Junction Restaurant & Sports Bar, 777 Jamacha Road, El Cajon, Ca. The car show will start at noon and dinner will start at 5:30 PM. <P>For those of you closer to the LA/Orange County area there will be a caravan we will be meeting at 9 AM at the FOCOA Headquarters and leaving at 9:30 SHARP!<BR> <BR>1598 S. Anaheim Blvd. Unit B<BR>Anaheim, CA 92683.<BR>(just north of the 5 freeway)<P>For anyone interested! ||||reg||6
